    "bodyMarkdown": "# Customer Proof Finder\n\nUse this workflow to turn customer praise into approved testimonials, proof cards, and social posts.\n\n## Minimal gate\n\nDefault path: (`gmail-mcp` OR `notion-mcp` OR `google-sheets-mcp`) AND in-chat proof list.\n\n- Use Gmail for email quotes.\n- Use Notion or Sheets for saved testimonials, customer lists, and approval trackers.\n- Add `figma-api` only for branded quote cards.\n- Add `cloudinary-mcp` only for asset hosting/storage.\n- Add `buffer-mcp` only for publishing/scheduling.\n\n## Gate protocol\n\nInstall one proof source. Add creative/storage/publishing only if requested.\n\n## Execution\n\n1. Search for positive quotes by date, account, product, or keyword.\n2. Score proof strength and redact sensitive data.\n3. Verify account/customer context when Notion or Sheets is selected.\n4. Create Figma cards only if selected.\n5. Store assets in Cloudinary only if selected.\n6. Queue Buffer posts only if selected.\n\n## Final app handoff\n\nBefore finishing, create a Harbor app for the user that exposes the workflow result, report, artifact, or next-action surface behind a Harbor URL. Use workspace-member access by default, and ask for confirmation before publishing anything public.\n\n## Output\n\nReturn approved quote candidates, redactions, source links, asset links, and scheduled post links.",
