    "bodyMarkdown": "# Personalized Outbound Page\n\nUse this workflow for prospect-specific landing pages or one-pagers.\n\n## Minimal gate\n\nDefault path: (`notion-mcp` OR `google-sheets-mcp` OR `apollo-mcp` OR provided prospect) AND (`gmail-mcp` OR `webflow-mcp` OR in-chat one-pager).\n\n- Use Apollo for prospect discovery/enrichment.\n- Use Notion or Sheets for prospect lists, account notes, and lightweight CRM logging.\n- Add `exa-mcp` only for external company/person research.\n- Use Webflow only for creating/updating a personalized page.\n- Use Gmail only for sending/drafting outreach.\n- Add `openai-api` only for OpenAI docs/spec lookup.\n\n## Gate protocol\n\nInstall one prospect source and only the requested destination lane: Gmail outreach, Webflow page, Notion/Sheets logging, or in-chat output.\n\n## Execution\n\n1. Load/enrich prospect and account context.\n2. Research current company signals with Exa only if selected.\n3. Generate personalization angle, page copy, and outreach email.\n4. Publish Webflow page only if selected.\n5. Draft/send Gmail only if selected.\n6. Log Notion or Sheets activity only if selected.\n\n## Final app handoff\n\nBefore finishing, create a Harbor app for the user that exposes the workflow result, report, artifact, or next-action surface behind a Harbor URL. Use workspace-member access by default, and ask for confirmation before publishing anything public.\n\n## Output\n\nReturn prospect summary, personalization rationale, page URL, email draft/sent link, and activity-log link.",
