    "bodyMarkdown": "# Product Launch Command Center\n\nUse this workflow to coordinate launch work across planning, creative, publishing, analytics, and comms.\n\n## Minimal gate\n\nDefault path: (`notion-mcp` OR direct launch brief) AND at least one requested execution lane.\n\n- Add `notion-mcp` for checklist, launch plan, or docs.\n- Add `figma-api` only for launch assets/designs.\n- Add `webflow-mcp` only for website/page updates.\n- Add `buffer-mcp` only for social scheduling.\n- Add `posthog-mcp` only for launch analytics/adoption monitoring.\n- Add `slack-mcp` only for launch-room updates or approvals.\n\n## Gate protocol\n\nInstall Notion only if the plan/artifact lives there, then install the requested execution lanes. Do not install design, web, social, analytics, and Slack unless all are requested.\n\n## Execution\n\n1. Parse launch date, product, audience, channels, and owners.\n2. Build or update launch checklist if Notion is selected.\n3. Generate assets through Figma/Figma only if selected.\n4. Update Webflow only if selected.\n5. Schedule Buffer posts only if selected.\n6. Monitor PostHog only if selected.\n7. Post Slack status only if selected.\n\n## Final app handoff\n\nBefore finishing, create a Harbor app for the user that exposes the workflow result, report, artifact, or next-action surface behind a Harbor URL. Use workspace-member access by default, and ask for confirmation before publishing anything public.\n\n## Output\n\nReturn checklist/doc link, asset links, page update links, scheduled posts, analytics readout, and Slack message link as applicable.",
